<title>JAPAN: Seijo Corp plans 1.1-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Seijo Corp plans 1.1-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seijo Corp said on Monday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on November 20, for shareholders as of September 30.</p>
</text>
